                {
                    "file": "gui/gui_test/security_and_access_menu/test_policies_sub_menu.robot",
                    "line": 231,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "George Keishing",
                        "email": "gkeishin@gmail.com",
                        "username": "gkeishin"
                    },
                    "message": "Missing UI-to-API State Verification\n\nTest toggles GUI but doesn't verify the Redfish API state changed\n\nGap: Between line 240 (GUI toggle) and line 244 (curl test), there's no verification that ${resp[\"Oem\"][\"OpenBMC\"][\"AuthMethods\"][\"BasicAuth\"]} actually changed to False\n\nIf GUI toggle fails silently, test might pass even though authentication policy wasn't actually disabled\n\nImpact: False positive - test claims security policy works when it might not"
                },
                {
                    "file": "gui/gui_test/security_and_access_menu/test_policies_sub_menu.robot",
                    "line": 231,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Sridevi Ramesh",
                        "email": "sridevra@in.ibm.com",
                        "username": "SrideviRamesh"
                    },
                    "message": "Toggle Policy Option And Verify Toast Message\n\nIn this keyword the validation is performed after toggling \n\n```\n# Performing first toggle operation.\n    Click Element  ${xpath_input_toggle_option}\n    Page Should Contain  ${expected_toast_msg}\n    # Refresh GUI and wait to reflect policy status.\n    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds  1 min  30 sec\n    ...  Refresh GUI And Verify Element Value  ${xpath_input_toggle_option}     ${expected_toggle_status}\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "gui/gui_test/security_and_access_menu/test_policies_sub_menu.robot",
                    "line": 231,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "George Keishing",
                        "email": "gkeishin@gmail.com",
                        "username": "gkeishin"
                    },
                    "message": "Acknowledged"
                },
                {
                    "file": "gui/gui_test/security_and_access_menu/test_policies_sub_menu.robot",
                    "line": 235,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "George Keishing",
                        "email": "gkeishin@gmail.com",
                        "username": "gkeishin"
                    },
                    "message": "Race Condition Potential\n\nNo wait/delay between GUI toggle (line 240) and authentication test (line 244)\nGUI changes might not propagate to Redfish authentication layer immediately\nCould cause intermittent test failures or false positives"
                },
                {
                    "file": "gui/gui_test/security_and_access_menu/test_policies_sub_menu.robot",
                    "line": 235,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Sridevi Ramesh",
                        "email": "sridevra@in.ibm.com",
                        "username": "SrideviRamesh"
                    },
                    "message": "all these are handled in \n\n```\n\nToggle Policy Option And Verify Toast Message\n    [Documentation]  Toggle required policy option and verify toast message.\n    [Arguments]  ${xpath_input_toggle_option}  ${expected_toast_msg}\n    ...  ${expected_toggle_status}\n\n    # Description of argument(s):\n    # xpath_input_toggle_option    Input required xpath toggle option.\n    # expected_toast_msg           Expected toast message post toggle option.\n    # expected_toggle_status       Expected toggle status.\n\n    # Performing first toggle operation.\n    Click Element  ${xpath_input_toggle_option}\n    Page Should Contain  ${expected_toast_msg}\n    # Refresh GUI and wait to reflect policy status.\n    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds  1 min  30 sec\n    ...  Refresh GUI And Verify Element Value  ${xpath_input_toggle_option}  ${expected_toggle_status}\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "gui/gui_test/security_and_access_menu/test_policies_sub_menu.robot",
                    "line": 235,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "George Keishing",
                        "email": "gkeishin@gmail.com",
                        "username": "gkeishin"
                    },
                    "message": "Acknowledged"
                },
                {
                    "file": "gui/gui_test/security_and_access_menu/test_policies_sub_menu.robot",
                    "line": 240,
                    "reviewer": {
