                        "username": "gkeishin"
                    },
                    "message": "Incomplete Security Validation\n\nTest only validates HTTP 401 response code in output\n\nDoesn't verify the authentication failure reason (should be \"BasicAuth disabled\" not other auth failures)"
                },
